# Runtime code only. The Aug-30 prod image was built from a working tree and carried an
# 807 MB local .venv, wav fixtures and spikes/node_modules; none of it is used at runtime.
# Fixture *data* is excluded, not the fixture helpers: tests/fixtures/make_stem_fixtures.py
# regenerates the wavs, so the tests baked into the image still collect and run.
.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache
**/node_modules
spikes
**/*.wav
**/*.mp3
**/*.flac
.env
.env.*
